Protocol source:
https://github.com/racehub-io/racehub-iracing-udp/blob/main/racehub_iracing_udp/iracing_message.proto
https://github.com/racehub-io/rfactor2-udp-broadcaster/blob/main/rFactor2UdpBroadcaster/telemetry.proto

Rust bindings are generated with prost-build 0.14.3 and protoc 33.4.
The generation input marks scalar fields optional to preserve wire presence.
Field numbers and wire types match the original schemas in schemas/.
For iRacing, only the identified player receives player-only channel defaults.
Other drivers keep those channels absent.
Proto3 zero defaults in complete rFactor 2 telemetry messages keep their defined meaning.
